Subject: Guard Compose-only dependencies when enable_compose=false

Baseline: Chromium 154.0.8037.58
Commit: a654841425914cbb703a2931e07b70a83aedbafd

Follow existing enable_compose and ENABLE_COMPOSE conventions. The Glic
interactive test needs Compose eligibility before FRE; guard that scenario
only, retaining the mixed source and all unrelated tests. No runtime or
service-policy changes. See docs/COMPOSE_POLICY_REVIEW.md for the boundary.

